    "tpc_book": "<div>1. Borrini-Feyerabend, G., M. Pimbert, M. T. Farvar, A. Kothari and Y. Renard. 2004. Sharing Power: Learning by doing in co-management of natural resources throughout the world. Cenesta, Tehran, IIED and IUCN/ CEESP/ CMWG<br />\n2. Frankfort-Nachmias, C. and D. Nachmias. 1992. Research Methods in the Social Sciences. London, Edward Arnold<br />\n3. Stake, R. E. 1994. Case Study. Handbook of Qualitative Research. N. K. a. L. Denzin, Y. S. London, Sage Publications.<br />\n4. Tashakkori, A. and C. Teddlie. 1998. Mixed Methodology: Combining Qualitative and Quantitative Approaches. London, U.K., Sage Publications Ltd.<br />\n5. Yin, R. K. 1994. Case Study Research: Design and Methods. London, U.K., Sage Publications Inc.<br />\n6. Yin, R. K. 2003. Applications of Case Study Research. London, U.K., Sage Publications Ltd.</div>\n",
